    "description": {
      "zh-cn": "邓小平在法国勤工俭学时与周恩来相识并结下深厚友谊，回国后长期在周恩来领导下工作，并在周恩来的支持下于文革中复出。邓小平认为，除周恩来外，与他关系最亲近的就是李富春、蔡畅夫妇。",
      "en": "Deng Xiaoping met Zhou Enlai during his work-study program in France and formed a deep friendship. After returning to China, he worked under Zhou's leadership for a long time and made a comeback during the Cultural Revolution with Zhou's support."
    }
  },
